{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0da90645688a2c6f8504c2e70291f396a64f27611b8ef244ca39fad98edd45e8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":".ccb/ccb_memory.md serves as the project-wide shared memory document for collaboration rules, constraints, and agent handoff conventions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1e74c304ac2110b700908e69626b45591ca5c1a006512933036848e27edb3089"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The mobile gateway binds to loopback by default; LAN binding requires a specific private interface address, and remote access uses Tailscale Serve rather than Funnel."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2f2773f26d08e34e262f0d3434ecbec45f9935d7062db3db2d26352c4c952617"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Version-2 config uses [windows] entries where commas and semicolons denote vertical stacking and horizontal splits, e.g. A,B;C,D as a four-pane layout."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3c10d6eaaee86fbbda28baaa1681eba4d70f346116c3c7a158fdd55d20d18704"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agents can invoke /ask during workflow orchestration to delegate and hand off work, and users can type directly in any agent pane."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6b3f9b46ef5566b57d4377427437e04fae0ad0d94d7f583d46718e31fd918972"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Release notes state that DeepSeek CLI, Z.ai, and DeepSeek Harness remain implemented but are no longer presented as current headline provider support."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6dcd2c09f9c1eb2009aedb09c19ecdfeec2b0d2e90b02e1ad27b300f61f9acd1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A background daemon keeps project state alive even after the foreground UI is closed, per the README's feature list."},{"claim_ids":["clm_82c87afa9521263bb3701c48ee167b8b5dfc3e5c011e9e0ffed63ba21c83b78f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Project configuration executing tool-window commands or custom provider command templates requires exact external approval via ccb config approve-commands."},{"claim_ids":["clm_85803b6453668e8b195ef7066087fc45c7b6214dbf206533cc85434269d31cae"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The native Windows x64 beta requires Python 3.10+, WezTerm, Git Bash, and Herdr 0.8.0 or newer, with an install-local managed Python runtime."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ae5e5b6893353475db1f3081cdcb2499787b570194f2521bdec857567c7809f1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README badges list version 8.6.13, platforms Linux/macOS/WSL/Windows beta, and 16 CLI provider families."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cc436b4776af489152359ab539d738eeea1f043809d93d9df8a352bb742f9397"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Config UI binds to loopback only; a token source is configured in .ccb/ccb.config, and the CLI prints the URL and token source but never the token value."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f4b7670ca95cce1abe3efa3233b723ea86ce31bfd36fb29070e79caac5e0f4c5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Supported managed agents receive built-in ask, ccb-clear, ccb-compact, and ccb-diagnose control skills even when optional skill inheritance is disabled."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f8eec5c95f482c380c95364d0f3cf607f2cc23fe37990d718d3cd206b8f6d34e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"CCB is described as a lightweight multi-agent TUI that coordinates CLI agents such as Codex, Claude, and Gemini in visible, controllable workflows."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0da90645688a2c6f8504c2e70291f396a64f27611b8ef244ca39fad98edd45e8","clm_1e74c304ac2110b700908e69626b45591ca5c1a006512933036848e27edb3089","clm_2f2773f26d08e34e262f0d3434ecbec45f9935d7062db3db2d26352c4c952617","clm_3c10d6eaaee86fbbda28baaa1681eba4d70f346116c3c7a158fdd55d20d18704","clm_6b3f9b46ef5566b57d4377427437e04fae0ad0d94d7f583d46718e31fd918972","clm_6dcd2c09f9c1eb2009aedb09c19ecdfeec2b0d2e90b02e1ad27b300f61f9acd1","clm_82c87afa9521263bb3701c48ee167b8b5dfc3e5c011e9e0ffed63ba21c83b78f","clm_85803b6453668e8b195ef7066087fc45c7b6214dbf206533cc85434269d31cae","clm_ae5e5b6893353475db1f3081cdcb2499787b570194f2521bdec857567c7809f1","clm_cc436b4776af489152359ab539d738eeea1f043809d93d9df8a352bb742f9397","clm_f4b7670ca95cce1abe3efa3233b723ea86ce31bfd36fb29070e79caac5e0f4c